wikipedia_extract: 'The Special 2TL Type (特2TL型, Toku 2TL gata) was a class of auxiliary
  escort carriers built for the Imperial Japanese Army during World War II. They were
  converted from Type 2TL tankers. It is also called the Yamashio Maru (山汐丸) class
  in some western sources.

  Only the name ship was completed during the war and she was sunk by American aircraft
  before she could be used.'
